<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Lever half year profits fall.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Lever half year profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Lever Brothers of Nigeria to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	    1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    4,244   vs     3,741</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    877   vs     1,183</p>
<p>Taxation			241   vs	 436</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     636   vs	 747</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
